id-at-gLUE2UserDomainLevel OBJECT IDENTIFIER ::= { 1 3 6 1 4 1 6757 100 1 1 7 1 }
id-at-gLUE2UserDomainUserManager OBJECT IDENTIFIER ::= { 1 3 6 1 4 1 6757 100 1 1 7 2 }
id-at-gLUE2UserDomainMember OBJECT IDENTIFIER ::= { 1 3 6 1 4 1 6757 100 1 1 7 3 }
